{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17200","headline":"奉和鄜州刘大夫麦秋出师遮虏有怀中朝亲故 · 权德舆","name":"奉和鄜州刘大夫麦秋出师遮虏有怀中朝亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子爱全才，故人雄外台。\n绿油登上将，青绶亚中台。\n亭障鸣笳入，风云转斾来。\n兰坊分杳杳，麦壠望莓莓。\n月向琱弓满，莲依宝劒开。\n行师齐鹤列，锡马尽龙媒。\n壮志徵梁甫，嘉招萃楚材。\n千寻推直干，百链去纤埃。\n间阔劳相望，欢言幸早陪。\n每联花下骑，几泛竹间杯。\n芳讯双鱼远，流年两鬓催。\n何时介圭觐，携手咏康哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}